SUMMARY:Monday Night Football : USA vs Belgium
DESCRIPTION:Discover Durham Together\nCome join us for the USA vs Belgium 
 round of 16 World Cup match. The US will be looking to get revenge from th
 eir 2014 World Cup loss to the Belgians\, so this should be an exciting ga
 me to say the least.\n\nWe'll be headed back to Bull McCabe's for this con
 test. Kickoff is at 8pm\, but I'll be there around 6:30 to grab a spot.\n\
 nLook for parking on or around Main St. There's also the Corcoran St. park
 ing garage which is free after 7 on weeknights. Bull McCabe's will be busy
  for this game so I would highly recommend you arrive at least an hour bef
 ore kickoff.*
